#### **2. Two dimentional array **

An array which have elements with two subscript are known as two dimentional array .
A two dimentional array consist of rows & colums it is also known as double dimentional array.

#### **syntax**:

Datatype name of array [size of row]. [size of colum];

#### **Example**:
int a[10] [10];
float avg [5] [5];

